doctype html
html
  head
    meta(charset="UTF-8")
    meta(name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0")
    title Meeting Scheduled Notification
    style.
      body {
        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        background-color: #f6f8fa;
        padding: 20px;
      }
      .container {
        max-width: 600px;
        background: #ffffff;
        padding: 24px;
        border-radius: 8px;
      }
      .btn {
        display: inline-block;
        padding: 12px 20px;
        background: #4f46e5;
        color: #ffffff;
        text-decoration: none;
        border-radius: 6px;
        margin-top: 16px;
      }

  body
    .container
      h2 Hello Zone Manager,
      p A meeting has been scheduled between a client and a doula. Below are the meeting details:

      ul
        li
          strong Client Name:
          |  #{clientName}
        li
          strong Service:
          |  #{serviceName}
        li
          strong Doula:
          |  #{doulaName}
        li
          strong Date:
          |  #{date}
        li
          strong Time:
          |  #{startTime} – #{endTime}

      p You may join or monitor the meeting using the link below:
      a.btn(href=meetingLink target="_blank") View / Join Meeting

      p(style="margin-top:24px")
        | This is an informational notification. No action is required unless necessary.

      p
        | Regards,
        br
        strong Bambini Doulas Team
